  "description": "The Job Applicant Screening System evaluates candidates based on predefined criteria to determine their eligibility for a job role. This ensures an efficient hiring process by filtering out unsuitable applicants and shortlisting the best candidates.\n\nThe system evaluates four critical factors:\nEducational Qualification – Ensures candidates meet the minimum required academic background for the role.\nWork Experience – Assesses whether the applicant has relevant industry experience.\nSkill Match – Checks if the candidate possesses the required skills for the position.\nAssessment Score – Evaluates candidates based on test results, interviews, or technical evaluations.",
